== Hold: a client that has been on 5 GHz here is kept off 2.4 GHz for a moment when it comes to join, and joins 5 GHz
  60  ban 02:00:00:00:00:0a on phy1-ap2 for 2500 ms
      { "at": 1791770060, "mac": "02:00:00:00:00:0a", "network": "test", "method": "hold", "from": "2g", "asked": "held", "outcome": "moved", "took": 1.0, "to": [ "5g" ], "signal": -52 }
  It leaves; later it joins 2.4 GHz all the same, once the moment is over, and its next try is not held:
